function CatalogPicker({title,value,options,onChange,compact=false}:{title:string;value:string;options:string[];onChange:(value:string)=>void;compact?:boolean}){const [visible,setVisible]=useState(false),[search,setSearch]=useState('');const shown=options.filter(item=>item.toLocaleLowerCase('az-AZ').includes(search.trim().toLocaleLowerCase('az-AZ'))).slice(0,120);return <><Pressable accessibilityRole="button" onPress={()=>{setSearch('');setVisible(true);}} style={[styles.field,{justifyContent:'center',marginTop:compact?0:5,minHeight:compact?39:43,paddingHorizontal:compact?5:11,flex:compact?1:undefined,borderWidth:compact?0:1,backgroundColor:compact?'transparent':'#F8F9FA'}]}><Text style={{color:value?INK:'#7A8491',fontSize:compact?12:13,flexShrink:1}}>{value||title}</Text></Pressable><Modal visible={visible} animationType="slide" onRequestClose={()=>setVisible(false)}><View style={{flex:1,backgroundColor:BG,paddingTop:40}}><View style={styles.header}><Text style={styles.heading}>{title}</Text><Pressable onPress={()=>setVisible(false)}><Text style={styles.link}>Bağla</Text></Pressable></View><View style={styles.search}><Feather name="search" size={17} color={MUTED}/><TextInput value={search} onChangeText={setSearch} placeholder={`${title} axtar`} style={styles.input}/></View><ScrollView keyboardShouldPersistTaps="handled" contentContainerStyle={{padding:16}}>{shown.map(option=><Pressable key={option} onPress={()=>{onChange(option);setVisible(false);}} style={[styles.spec,{paddingVertical:14}]}><Text style={styles.specVal}>{option}</Text><Feather name="chevron-right" size={17} color={MUTED}/></Pressable>)}{shown.length===0&&<Text style={styles.stateBody}>Uyğun seçim tapılmadı.</Text>}</ScrollView></View></Modal></>}
